## Purpose

Make `100k` the standard CEO-level project control surface: a concise, easy-to-find review that
shows the whole current project picture, explains what changed, recommends the next safe cycles,
and exposes a complete ledger so material work cannot disappear during promotion or completion.

## Desired Outcome

Every installed Tool Shed can deterministically render `work/100k.md` from its one canonical
project-world projection. The page presents executive state, coverage and attention signals,
recommended next cycles, recently changed direction, and an exhaustive lifecycle ledger. It is a
read-only projection: current intent and dispositions remain in the existing authoritative project
maps, focus areas, Ideas, PRMs, campaigns, outcomes, relationships, and decisions.

