## Settled Direction

- Formal name: Project Executive View. Stable operator name and command: `100k`.
- Stable human entry point: generated `work/100k.md` with an explicit read-only header and refresh
  command. No manually edited parallel copy is introduced.
- Canonical input: `project_projection.build(workspace)`, extended only where executive consumers
  require an existing project-world fact not already represented.
- Item state: reuse document lifecycle, planning order/readiness, typed relationships, outcome
  lifecycle/disposition, reconciliation, recursive closure, and loop findings.
- Coverage: include every Idea, project map, PRM, and campaign in the bounded canonical inventory;
  call out active records without an accountable parent/output or with open closure/findings.
- Operator convergence: 100k becomes the normal human review; existing status, overview, planning
  order, queue, and loop commands remain deterministic drill-down and automation APIs.
- The living view itself does not complete. Its finite Work2 implementation campaign can complete;
  later project horizons remain visible through current authoritative artifacts and outcomes.

